---@field multiagent? anthropic.beta_agents.BetaManagedAgentsMultiagentParams|distilled.Null Multiagent orchestration configuration. Full replacement. Omit to preserve; send null to clear.
---@field execution_identity? anthropic.beta_agents.BetaManagedAgentsExecutionIdentityParams|distilled.Null Execution principal for runs of this agent. Full replacement. Omit to preserve; send null or `{"type": "service_account"}` to restore the default.

